<svelte:head><title>Privacy & retention — PuntersEdge</title></svelte:head><article class="surface mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-5 p-6"><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Privacy & retention</h1><p>We use verified account details to provide membership, save analysis tickets, support users and reconcile subscription payments. Tester profiles include contact, date of birth and location information. We do not store your card security code or banking password.</p><h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Activity and retention</h2><p>Presence is sampled, not continuous surveillance. Recent device activity is bounded. Account events are retained for 90 days; administrator change records for 365 days. Minimal payment and dispute references are retained for up to seven years for reconciliation and dispute handling. These are operational retention periods, not a statement of any specific legal obligation.</p><h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Your controls</h2><p>Use <a class="text-model underline" href="/account/privacy">account privacy controls</a> to export your information or request deletion. Erasure removes profile, tickets, device registrations, activity and authentication data, and removes contact and checkout details from retained financial records. Financial disputes must be resolved before erasure is fulfilled.</p><h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Service providers</h2><p>Cloudflare stores and delivers application assets and bulk sports data. Convex holds account and access records. Better Auth manages sessions; Resend delivers account emails. Flutterwave and Korapay process payments. Their services have their own privacy terms. Forecast estimates do not guarantee winnings or recovery of losses.</p><h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Questions</h2><p>Contact puntersedge@ewinproject.org with privacy requests or corrections. Do not send passwords, authenticator keys or card details.</p></article>